# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### GET /test
-  the `header` request parameter `x-owner` became nullable
-  the `header` request parameter `x-status` became nullable
-  the `owner` property of the `header` request parameter `x-meta` became nullable
-  the `status` property of the `header` request parameter `x-meta` became nullable






